late&gt;\r\n  &lt;input type=&quot;text&quot; @input=&quot;month = $event.target.value&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;/template&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;script&gt;\r\nexport default {\r\n  name: &#39;ModalDetail&#39;,\r\n  data(){\r\n    return {\r\n      month: 1,\r\n    }\r\n  },\r\n}\r\n&lt;/script&gt;</code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></pre></div>\n<p>사용자가 input에 입력한 데이터는 String이다.</p>\n<h2 id=\"예제\" style=\"position:relative;\">예제<a href=\"#%EC%98%88%EC%A0%9C\" aria-label=\"예제 permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h2>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"vue\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-vue line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-vue\">&lt;template&gt;\r\n  &lt;div class=&quot;modal_wrap black-bg&quot; v-if=&quot;모달창열렸니==1&quot;&gt;\r\n    &lt;div class=&quot;white-bg&quot;&gt;\r\n      &lt;img :src=&quot;원룸들[누른거].image&quot; class=&quot;room-img&quot;&gt;\r\n      &lt;h4&gt;{{ 원룸들[누른거].title }}&lt;/h4&gt;\r\n      &lt;p&gt;{{ 원룸들[누른거].content }}&lt;/p&gt;\r\n      &lt;div&gt;개월 수 : &lt;input type=&quot;text&quot; @input=&quot;month = $event.target.value&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n      &lt;p&gt;[{{month}}개월 선택] {{ 원룸들[누른거].price * month }}원&lt;/p&gt;\r\n      &lt;button @click=&quot;closeModal&quot;&gt;닫기&lt;/button&gt;\r\n    &lt;/div&gt;\r\n  &lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/template&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;script&gt;\r\nexport default {\r\n  name: &#39;ModalDetail&#39;,\r\n  data(){\r\n    return {\r\n      month: 1,\r\n    }\r\n  },\r\n  props: {\r\n    원룸들: Object, // Number, String, Array\r\n    누른거: Number,\r\n    모달창열렸니: Number,\r\n  },\r\n  methods: {\r\n    closeModal(){\r\n      this.$emit(&#39;closeModal&#39;);\r\n    }\r\n  }\r\n}\r\n&lt;/script&gt;</code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></pre></div>\n<h2 id=\"v-model\" style=\"position:relative;\">v-model<a href=\"#v-model\" aria-label=\"v model permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h2>\n<p>input, textarea, select 등 모든 입력받는 form요소에 사용할 수 있다.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"vue\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-vue line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-vue\">&lt;!-- &lt;input type=&quot;text&quot; @input=&quot;month = $event.target.value&quot;&gt; -